# =============================================================================
# This is the UMBRELLA repository. It tracks docs/ and workspace config ONLY.
#
# Every project folder below is an INDEPENDENT git repository with its own
# history and remote. They are ignored here so that git never sees inside them
# — no nesting, no gitlinks, no double-tracking. Run ./bootstrap.sh to clone
# them into place.
# =============================================================================

